==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|fr}} {{m|frm|saulver}}, from {{etyl|fro|fr}} {{m|fro|sauver}}, from [[Gallo-Romance]] {{m|fro|salvar}}, from {{etyl|LL.|fr}} {{m|la|salvāre}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|salvō||I save}}, from {{etyl|la|fr}} {{m|la|salvus}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Fr-sauver.ogg|audio|lang=fr}}
* {{IPA|/so.ve/|lang=fr}}

===Verb===
{{fr-verb}}

# to [[save]], [[rescue]]; to [[protect]]
# {{lb|fr|computing}} to save
# {{lb|fr|pronominal}} to [[escape]], [[run away]]

====Conjugation====
{{fr-conj-auto}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|computing}} {{l|fr|sauvegarder}}

